bai (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Allow most env-style settings to be read from files in the bai config
    directory, with environment variables still taking precedence.
  * Document the config-file mapping and prompt addendum behavior more clearly.
  * Publish bai as version 0.3.1.
  * Optional clipboard integration remains external: install `xclip`
    or `wl-clipboard` if you want automatic copy-to-clipboard support.

 -- trans <transfire@gmail.com>  Thu, 21 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
